  "prefLabel": "He-W 569.03 Provider Participation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 569.03 Provider Participation. All participating radiological service providers shall:\n\n(a) Be licensed by the states in which they practice;\n\n(b) Provide radiological services under the direction of a physician in accordance with 42 CFR 440.30; and\n\n(c) Be an enrolled New Hampshire medicaid provider.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading He-W 500); ss by #6575, eff 9-12-97; ss by #8400, INTERIM, eff 8-20-05, EXPIRES: 2-16-06; ss by #8562, eff 2-7-06; ss by #10517, eff 2-7-14, EXPIRED: 2-7-24\n\nNew. 14277, eff 6-24-25, EXPIRES: 6-24-35",
